        <mxCell id="note" value="Code: softarm.controllers.DelayAwareNDOSMC(exact_preview=True) with the observer on. Nikoletta&#39;s gains: λ = 4 s⁻¹, l₁ = 0.1, l₂ = 0, μ = 1 mm, Φ = 1, ε = 1. Same structure as the SMC page plus the observer, which acts on the predicted tip q̂.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blue: computed by the controller every 10 ms. Dashed: model run inside the controller. Grey: the simulator (make_calibrated_sim). Tip q in mm from the settled pose; pressures in psi." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
