        <mxCell id="note" value="Code: softarm.controllers.DelayMPC on softarm.models.M2. M2: τ ṗ = −p + G u(t−T), ẏ = −Λ y + Λ H p (docs/figures/task_space_model.json). R&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; tuned per horizon on a 5 mm, 0.07 Hz circle (chosen 10⁻⁵ mm²/psi²; also run at R&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; = 1 and 10). Clipping is not in the optimisation; the clipped command enters the buffer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blue: computed by the controller every 10 ms. Dashed: model run inside the controller. Grey: the simulator (make_calibrated_sim). Tip q in mm from the settled pose; pressures in psi." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
