        <mxCell id="note" value="Code: softarm.controllers.KalmanDelayMPC(preview=&quot;oracle&quot;) with the true future reference, as built by softarm.controllers.known_reference. F: per-channel state-space model x&lt;sub&gt;n+1&lt;/sub&gt; = A&lt;sub&gt;d&lt;/sub&gt; x&lt;sub&gt;n&lt;/sub&gt; + B&lt;sub&gt;d&lt;/sub&gt; u&lt;sub&gt;n−d&lt;/sub&gt; identified from frequency responses (scripts/sysid_frf.py). Unlike M2, F does not model z and treats x and y as independent channels.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blue: computed by the controller every 10 ms. Dashed: model run inside the controller. Grey: the simulator (make_calibrated_sim). Tip q in mm from the settled pose; pressures in psi." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
